[7.836896, "o", "   raw_row_number        date      time               location    county_name  subject_age subject_race subject_sex officer_id_hash           department_name       type  arrest_made  citation_issued  warning_issued   outcome  contraband_found  contraband_drugs  contraband_weapons  frisk_performed  search_conducted  search_person  search_vehicle  search_basis  reason_for_frisk  reason_for_search            reason_for_stop raw_Ethnicity raw_Race raw_action_description\r\n0         1219541  2001-12-28       NaN  Durham, Durham County  Durham County           22        black      female      5b9908c1a5  Durham Police Department  vehicular        False            False            True   warning               NaN               NaN                 NaN            False             False          False           False           NaN               NaN                NaN              Investigation             N        B         Verbal Warning\r\n1         1221117  2002-01-02  04:00:00  Durham, Durham County  Durham County           28     hispanic        male      0c140e68b5  Durham Police Department  vehicular        False             True           False  citation               NaN               NaN                 NaN            False             False          False           False           NaN               NaN                NaN  Stop Light/Sign Violation             H        W        Citation Issued\r\n"]
